                                        "entry_id": "685272ee-5034-31e8-81ea-87e38453c5de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of a genre of computer role playing games loosely characterized by various characteristics such as randomised environment generation, permadeath, turn-based movement, text-based or primitive tile-based graphics, and hack-and-slash gameplay."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c844e14-97ed-47f9-82f8-2d4d5d78ee70",
                                                "sense_id": "15a91bb1-bc6e-3f70-b723-af5990531f80",
                                                "text": "If you haven’t played a ‘roguelike’ before, it’s basically what happens when you take a twitchy hack-and-slash game like Diablo and make it boring, confusing, and frustrating."
                                            }
